---
model: googleai/gemini-2.5-pro
input:
    schema:
        description?: string    
        imageUrls?(array): string
---

Based on the provided information, describe the attribuites od a "dream!" for a vacation that matches the following information:
{{#if description}}
Description: {{description}}{{/if}}

{{#if imageUrls.length}}
Use the following images for inspiration as well, taking into account activities, or "vide".

{{#each imageUrls}}{{media url=this}}{{/each}}{{/if}}

Respond with a three-sentences description of what the ideal place.
Don't use any specific place names, instead include the types od activities.

